410-| Case | Expected |
411-|---|---|
412-| Key absent / new install | blinks; Q2-B: nothing written, `:cfg` shows `blink (default)`; Q2-A: `motion: blink` written on the next save |
413-| `static` | steady `●` (same glyph and colour as running), no blink chain; jobs still tick at 100 ms for footer spinners with the phase pinned on |
414-| `flash`, `Static`, `3` | blinks; `WARN [config] app.motion …` per load; kept as read and saved back unchanged; `:cfg` app tab shows a warning-level status |
415-| list / map value | Q1: A → load error like any `app.*` key (documented); B → WARN + blink |
416-| Invalid, then ←/→ in `:cfg` | becomes `static` (either arrow), warning disappears, router applies it on the save |
417-| Blink → static while a blink chain lives | one trailing tick ≤ 500 ms, not renewed, no extra `FrameMsg` |
418-| Static → blink with a blinking view on screen | `Update` wrapper's `ensureTick` starts a 500 ms chain on that same `Update` |
419-| Context A static, B blink | switch flips `motionStatic` both ways; nothing global |
420-| YAML edited by hand while running | applied at next context switch / restart; a `:cfg` save in between overwrites it |
